        <briefdescription>
<para>Renders and prints the SPEC.md text as the <computeroutput>--help</computeroutput> banner body. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Parses <computeroutput>specText</computeroutput> as markdown, projects it through <ref refid="classjam_1_1MarkdownComponent" kindref="compound" external="/Users/jreng/Documents/Poems/dev/jam/docs/tagfile.xml">jam::MarkdownComponent</ref> onto a headless <ref refid="classjam_1_1terminal_1_1GraphicsEngine" kindref="compound" external="/Users/jreng/Documents/Poems/dev/jam/docs/tagfile.xml">jam::terminal::GraphicsEngine</ref> frame (word-wrapped to <computeroutput>widthCap</computeroutput> columns, minus a left/right margin of <computeroutput>documentMargin</computeroutput> columns), and prints the resulting cell grid to stdout.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>specText</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The specification text (SPEC §9: printed verbatim on <computeroutput>--help</computeroutput> and when no manifest is found). </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
</para>
